{
  "_comment": [
    "Model capability metadata keyed by model-id prefix (longest prefix wins).",
    "Ids are matched lower-cased on their last path segment, so gateway ids",
    "such as 'openai/gpt-6.1-sol' resolve too. Provider /models endpoints",
    "rarely report these limits, so the catalog enriches them from here.",
    "Unlisted models fall back to the prefix rules in capabilities.py.",
    "Sources: Anthropic, OpenAI and Google model docs (Oct 2026). The Gemini",
    "thinking_level lists mirror the Gemini 3 pro/flash split. Third-party",
    "ids (xAI, DeepSeek, Mistral) are preset suggestions, not verified here."
  ],
